<view class="page"><text class="eyebrow">OUR LITTLE COLLECTION</text><view class="title">每一次好奇<view>都值得被记住</view></view><text class="muted">已经一起看过 {{viewedCount}} 张词卡。</text><view class="tabs"><button class="{{mode==='favorites'?'primary':''}}" data-mode="favorites" bindtap="tab">我的收藏</button><button class="{{mode==='history'?'primary':''}}" data-mode="history" bindtap="tab">看过的词卡</button></view><view class="panel"><view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="empty"><view class="small-art">🌿</view><view>这里还没有词卡</view><text class="muted">从一个喜欢的小世界开始吧。</text><button bindtap="home">去探索</button></view><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="row list-item" bindtap="open" data-id="{{item.id}}"><text class="small-art">{{item.emoji}}</text><view class="item-label"><view>{{item.name}}</view><text class="muted">{{item.pinyin}}</text></view><text class="link">→</text></view></view><text class="muted">“看过”记录打开过的词卡，不代表宝宝已掌握。</text></view>